{"seq":2,"slug":"collections-framework","title":"Java 集合框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/java-core-fundamentals/collections-framework","wordCount":1258,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"java-集合框架\">Java 集合框架</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Java 集合框架（Java Collections Framework, JCF）是 <code>java.util</code> 包中一套统一的数据结构和算法 API。它以 Collection 和 Map 两大接口为根，衍生出 List、Set、Queue、Deque 等容器类型，是 Java 日常开发中使用频率最高的 API 之一。理解集合框架的内部数据结构和时间复杂度，对于写出高性能 Java 代码至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Iterable] --&gt; B[Collection]&#10;    B --&gt; C[List]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Set]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Queue]&#10;    C --&gt; F[ArrayList]&#10;    C --&gt; G[LinkedList]&#10;    D --&gt; H[HashSet]&#10;    D --&gt; I[TreeSet]&#10;    D --&gt; J[LinkedHashSet]&#10;    E --&gt; K[PriorityQueue]&#10;    E --&gt; L[ArrayDeque]&#10;    M[Map] --&gt; N[HashMap]&#10;    M --&gt; O[TreeMap]&#10;    M --&gt; P[LinkedHashMap]&#10;    M --&gt; Q[ConcurrentHashMap]\">graph TD\n    A[Iterable] --&gt; B[Collection]\n    B --&gt; C[List]\n    B --&gt; D[Set]\n    B --&gt; E[Queue]\n    C --&gt; F[ArrayList]\n    C --&gt; G[LinkedList]\n    D --&gt; H[HashSet]\n    D --&gt; I[TreeSet]\n    D --&gt; J[LinkedHashSet]\n    E --&gt; K[PriorityQueue]\n    E --&gt; L[ArrayDeque]\n    M[Map] --&gt; N[HashMap]\n    M --&gt; O[TreeMap]\n    M --&gt; P[LinkedHashMap]\n    M --&gt; Q[ConcurrentHashMap]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>有序性</th>\n<th>唯一性</th>\n<th>null 支持</th>\n<th>线程安全</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>List</td>\n<td>插入序</td>\n<td>允许重复</td>\n<td>允许</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>ArrayList, LinkedList</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set</td>\n<td>无序/有序</td>\n<td>唯一</td>\n<td>HashSet 允许</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>HashSet, TreeSet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Queue</td>\n<td>FIFO</td>\n<td>允许重复</td>\n<td>通常不允许</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>ArrayDeque, PriorityQueue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td>无序/有序</td>\n<td>Key 唯一</td>\n<td>HashMap 允许</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>HashMap, TreeMap</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hashmap-实现原理\">HashMap 实现原理</h2><p>HashMap 是 Java 中最常用的 Map 实现，基于哈希表（数组 + 链表 + 红黑树）。Java 8 引入了链表到红黑树的升级机制，将最坏情况的查找复杂度从 O(n) 降低到 O(log n)。</p>\n<p><strong>哈希计算与扰动函数</strong>：HashMap 对 key 的 hashCode() 进行二次哈希（高16位异或低16位），降低哈希碰撞概率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"static final int hash(Object key) {&#10;    int h;&#10;    return (key == null) ? 0 : (h = key.hashCode()) ^ (h &gt;&gt;&gt; 16);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Object key) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hashCode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>>></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数组索引计算</strong>：<code>index = (n - 1) &amp; hash</code>，其中 n 是数组长度（必须是 2 的幂）。位运算替代取模运算，性能更优。</p>\n<p><strong>扩容机制</strong>：当元素数量超过 <code>capacity × loadFactor</code>（默认 0.75）时触发扩容，容量翻倍。扩容需要重新计算所有元素的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; map = new HashMap&lt;&gt;(16, 0.75f);&#10;&#10;// 扩容时，每个元素要么留在原位，要么移动到 原位 + oldCapacity&#10;// 这由 hash &amp; oldCapacity 是否为 0 决定\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HashMap&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扩容时，每个元素要么留在原位，要么移动到 原位 + oldCapacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 这由 hash &#x26; oldCapacity 是否为 0 决定</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>树化与退化</strong>：当单个桶的链表长度 ≥ 8 且数组长度 ≥ 64 时，链表转为红黑树；当树节点数 ≤ 6 时退化回链表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"static final int TREEIFY_THRESHOLD = 8;&#10;static final int UNTREEIFY_THRESHOLD = 6;&#10;static final int MIN_TREEIFY_CAPACITY = 64;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TREEIFY_THRESHOLD </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UNTREEIFY_THRESHOLD </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MIN_TREEIFY_CAPACITY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>平均复杂度</th>\n<th>最坏复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>get</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>红黑树保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>put</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>可能触发扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>remove</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>containsKey</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>containsValue</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>需遍历所有桶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩容</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>重建哈希表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>初始容量优化</strong>：已知元素数量时，合理设置初始容量可避免多次扩容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"int expected = 1000;&#10;Map&lt;String, Object&gt; map = new HashMap&lt;&gt;((int) (expected / 0.75) + 1);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Map&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> map </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HashMap&#x3C;>((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (expected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"arraylist-与-linkedlist-对比\">ArrayList 与 LinkedList 对比</h2><p>ArrayList 基于动态数组，LinkedList 基于双向链表。两者在不同操作上有显著的性能差异。</p>\n<p><strong>ArrayList 扩容策略</strong>：初始容量 10，每次扩容为原容量的 1.5 倍（<code>oldCapacity + (oldCapacity &gt;&gt; 1)</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"List&lt;String&gt; list = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;// 内部数组增长：10 → 15 → 22 → 33 → ...&#10;// 扩容涉及 Arrays.copyOf，即整个数组的复制&#10;&#10;// 预分配减少扩容&#10;List&lt;String&gt; list = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(10000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> list </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内部数组增长：10 → 15 → 22 → 33 → ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扩容涉及 Arrays.copyOf，即整个数组的复制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 预分配减少扩容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> list </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>随机访问性能</strong>：ArrayList 支持 O(1) 的随机访问（实现了 RandomAccess 标记接口），LinkedList 需要从头或尾遍历到目标位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"List&lt;Integer&gt; arrayList = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(List.of(1, 2, 3, 4, 5));&#10;List&lt;Integer&gt; linkedList = new LinkedList&lt;&gt;(List.of(1, 2, 3, 4, 5));&#10;&#10;arrayList.get(2);   // O(1)：直接 elementData[2]&#10;linkedList.get(2);  // O(n)：从 head 或 tail 遍历\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> arrayList </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> linkedList </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LinkedList&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arrayList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// O(1)：直接 elementData[2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">linkedList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// O(n)：从 head 或 tail 遍历</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>插入和删除</strong>：LinkedList 在已知节点位置时插入/删除为 O(1)，但定位本身是 O(n)。ArrayList 的中间插入需要移动后续元素：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// ArrayList 头部插入：O(n) — 需要移动所有元素&#10;arrayList.add(0, element);&#10;&#10;// LinkedList 头部插入：O(1) — 直接修改指针&#10;linkedList.addFirst(element);&#10;&#10;// 但迭代器中间插入，两者差异不大&#10;// 因为 ArrayList 有 CPU 缓存友好的连续内存布局\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ArrayList 头部插入：O(n) — 需要移动所有元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arrayList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, element);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LinkedList 头部插入：O(1) — 直接修改指针</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">linkedList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addFirst</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 但迭代器中间插入，两者差异不大</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 因为 ArrayList 有 CPU 缓存友好的连续内存布局</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>ArrayList</th>\n<th>LinkedList</th>\n<th>选择建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机访问 get(i)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>ArrayList</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部追加 add(e)</td>\n<td>均摊 O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>均可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头部插入 add(0, e)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>LinkedList</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间插入</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)+定位 O(n)</td>\n<td>ArrayList（缓存友好）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>连续数组，紧凑</td>\n<td>每节点额外 2 指针</td>\n<td>ArrayList</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代性能</td>\n<td>快（缓存友好）</td>\n<td>慢（指针跳转）</td>\n<td>ArrayList</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实践建议</strong>：绝大多数场景优先选择 ArrayList。仅在需要频繁头部/中间插入且不需要随机访问时考虑 LinkedList，或者使用 ArrayDeque 替代 LinkedList 作为队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"treemap-与排序集合\">TreeMap 与排序集合</h2><p>TreeMap 基于红黑树实现，保证 key 的自然排序或自定义排序。它实现了 NavigableMap 接口，提供了丰富的范围查询能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"TreeMap&lt;String, Integer&gt; scores = new TreeMap&lt;&gt;();&#10;scores.put(&quot;Alice&quot;, 95);&#10;scores.put(&quot;Bob&quot;, 87);&#10;scores.put(&quot;Charlie&quot;, 92);&#10;scores.put(&quot;David&quot;, 88);&#10;&#10;scores.firstKey();                    // &quot;Alice&quot;&#10;scores.lastKey();                     // &quot;David&quot;&#10;scores.subMap(&quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;David&quot;);        // {Bob=87, Charlie=92}&#10;scores.headMap(&quot;Charlie&quot;);            // {Alice=95, Bob=87}&#10;scores.ceilingEntry(&quot;Ca&quot;);            // Charlie=92&#10;scores.floorEntry(&quot;Ca&quot;);             // Bob=87\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TreeMap&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TreeMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">87</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Charlie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">92</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"David\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">88</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">firstKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"Alice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lastKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();                     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"David\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"David\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// {Bob=87, Charlie=92}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">headMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Charlie\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// {Alice=95, Bob=87}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceilingEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ca\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Charlie=92</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floorEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Ca\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Bob=87</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自定义排序</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"TreeMap&lt;String, Integer&gt; caseInsensitive = new TreeMap&lt;&gt;(String.CASE_INSENSITIVE_ORDER);&#10;&#10;TreeMap&lt;Employee, String&gt; byAge = new TreeMap&lt;&gt;(&#10;    Comparator.comparingInt(Employee::getAge)&#10;              .thenComparing(Employee::getName)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TreeMap&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> caseInsensitive </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TreeMap&#x3C;>(String.CASE_INSENSITIVE_ORDER);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TreeMap&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Employee</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> byAge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TreeMap&#x3C;>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Comparator.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">comparingInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getAge)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">thenComparing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Employee</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">::</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">getName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>TreeSet 与 HashSet 的选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>HashSet</th>\n<th>TreeSet</th>\n<th>LinkedHashSet</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>底层结构</td>\n<td>HashMap</td>\n<td>TreeMap（红黑树）</td>\n<td>HashMap + 双向链表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>无序</td>\n<td>自然序/自定义序</td>\n<td>插入序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>add/remove/contains</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代顺序</td>\n<td>不可预测</td>\n<td>排序后顺序</td>\n<td>插入顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>null 支持</td>\n<td>允许一个</td>\n<td>不允许（需比较）</td>\n<td>允许一个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并发集合\">并发集合</h2><p>JDK 提供了多种线程安全的集合实现，从早期的同步包装器到 <code>java.util.concurrent</code> 下的高性能并发集合。</p>\n<p><strong>ConcurrentHashMap</strong>（Java 8+）放弃了分段锁，改为 CAS + synchronized 锁单个桶：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"ConcurrentHashMap&lt;String, AtomicLong&gt; counters = new ConcurrentHashMap&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;// 原子性计算&#10;counters.computeIfAbsent(&quot;pageViews&quot;, k -&gt; new AtomicLong()).incrementAndGet();&#10;&#10;// merge 操作&#10;counters.merge(&quot;clicks&quot;, new AtomicLong(1), (old, val) -&gt; {&#10;    old.addAndGet(val.get());&#10;    return old;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ConcurrentHashMap&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AtomicLong</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> counters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ConcurrentHashMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 原子性计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counters.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">computeIfAbsent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pageViews\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicLong</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">incrementAndGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// merge 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counters.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clicks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AtomicLong</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (old, val) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    old.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addAndGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(val.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> old;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>CopyOnWriteArrayList</strong> 适用于读远多于写的场景——每次修改都复制整个底层数组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"CopyOnWriteArrayList&lt;String&gt; listeners = new CopyOnWriteArrayList&lt;&gt;();&#10;&#10;// 写操作：复制整个数组，替换引用&#10;listeners.add(&quot;listener1&quot;);&#10;&#10;// 读操作：无锁，直接读取当前数组快照&#10;for (String listener : listeners) {&#10;    // 迭代期间不会抛出 ConcurrentModificationException&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CopyOnWriteArrayList&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> listeners </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CopyOnWriteArrayList&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 写操作：复制整个数组，替换引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">listeners.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"listener1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读操作：无锁，直接读取当前数组快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (String listener </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> listeners) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 迭代期间不会抛出 ConcurrentModificationException</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>选择指南</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐集合</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高并发读写 Map</td>\n<td>ConcurrentHashMap</td>\n<td>CAS + 细粒度锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读多写少 List</td>\n<td>CopyOnWriteArrayList</td>\n<td>无锁读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界阻塞队列</td>\n<td>ArrayBlockingQueue</td>\n<td>固定容量，生产者-消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无界阻塞队列</td>\n<td>LinkedBlockingQueue</td>\n<td>可选容量限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级队列</td>\n<td>PriorityBlockingQueue</td>\n<td>线程安全的堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟队列</td>\n<td>DelayQueue</td>\n<td>定时任务调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发 Set</td>\n<td>ConcurrentHashMap.newKeySet()</td>\n<td>基于 CHM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Java 集合框架以 Collection 和 Map 为根，提供了 List、Set、Queue、Map 四大体系</li>\n<li>HashMap 使用数组 + 链表 + 红黑树结构，链表长度 ≥ 8 时树化，已知容量时预设初始大小避免扩容</li>\n<li>ArrayList 在绝大多数场景优于 LinkedList，得益于 CPU 缓存友好的连续内存布局</li>\n<li>TreeMap/TreeSet 基于红黑树提供有序存储和范围查询，适用于需要排序的场景</li>\n<li>并发场景使用 ConcurrentHashMap（高并发读写）、CopyOnWriteArrayList（读多写少）等专用集合，避免使用 Collections.synchronizedXxx 包装器</li>\n<li>选择集合时关注三个维度：有序性需求、唯一性需求、并发安全需求</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Java 集合框架","id":"java-集合框架"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HashMap 实现原理","id":"hashmap-实现原理"},{"level":2,"text":"ArrayList 与 LinkedList 对比","id":"arraylist-与-linkedlist-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"TreeMap 与排序集合","id":"treemap-与排序集合"},{"level":2,"text":"并发集合","id":"并发集合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Java 类型系统与泛型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/java-core-fundamentals/type-system-and-generics"},"next":{"title":"Java 异常处理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/java-language/java-core-fundamentals/exception-handling-patterns"}}